Subject: [PATCH] export active bluetooth pairings before booting linux (#97)

save classic pairing keys beside the initrd for bluez to import
export by default and continue booting if export fails

(cherry picked from commit 5d3b11e67fc71f7ab52261d050238fd87c17aa7e)
